      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start for the intro, but I really need to dig deeper into the \"logic\" part for my thesis. I can't just say it was \"racist beliefs\"—my professor wants me to map out the actual pseudo-scientific or sociological frameworks they used to make it sound rational. Like, how did they use concepts like \"social cohesion\" or \"cultural preservation\" to make it seem like a logical necessity rather than just hate? Can you expand on those specific frameworks they leaned on?",
